config ZMK_KEY_EVENTS_GATT
    bool "Report key positions and active layers over a BLE GATT service"
    default y
    depends on ZMK_BLE && (!ZMK_SPLIT || ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL)
    help
      Exposes a GATT characteristic that notifies the host each time a
      physical key position is pressed or released, and whenever the set of
      active layers changes. Used by the Imprint companion app.
